== ARCHIVE: step_h S22 subset run, taken from the cluster working copy ==
Archived 2026-10-01. docs/tables_and_provenance.md (MAIN-skeleton) cites the water level-1
uncorrected interaction energy (-7.816) and the benzene level-0 XC/NLC split (-4.457 / -4.448
/ -0.009) straight out of this stdout, which lived only under nlcsplit/logs/ - gitignored, so a
reader could not open it. Body below is verbatim; the geometry-source path on its first line is a
cluster working directory and the exporter publishes a path-scrubbed copy with a ledger entry,
which is the normal route for these files. Source SHA-256: 122b3820b69e05722c0e515813775fd66c49b219a83ded6597ada9793a701071

